WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.242
A few numbers capture the impact.

00:00:02.322 --> 00:00:09.699
RPIembeddor scores a ROC area under the curve of
zero-point-seven-zero on the homology-separated test set,

00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:13.920
where the best competitor manages only
zero-point-five-zero.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.900
Its F1 of zero-point-five-nine and accuracy of
zero-point-six-seven lead all methods.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:25.880
The RNAInterAct dataset contributes over one
hundred twenty-two thousand interactions

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.187
spanning nine hundred seventy-six RNA families.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:35.308
And all of this runs in a compact
one-point-four-million-parameter model powered by the

00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:37.770
RNA-FM and ESM-2 foundation models.
